              "textField": "Drink plenty of water, (providing an explanation of &#039;why&#039;); avoid NSAIDs and aspirin; along with frequent blood tests, specifically *UECs (urea electrolyte and creatinine)* will help to decrease the *renal toxicity* associated with antifungal agents.\nDrink plenty of water, (providing an explanation of &#039;why&#039;); Frequent blood tests, specifically *LFTs*, and avoidance of alcohol and paracetamol will help decrease the possibility of *hepatotoxicity*"
